Projects can also be financed in other countries of the Program i.e. all countries participating have access to finance and can forward their projects to enable the highest quality ones to be selected. Examples of other projects discussed include:

- Argentina: Replacement of up to 300 diesel buses with electric units in Buenos Aires;
- Argentina: Replacement of up to 30 diesel buses with electric units in Tucuman;
- Costa Rica: Replacement of up to 200 diesel buses with electric units in the larger urban area of San Jose;
- Dominican Republic: Replacement of up to 150 articulated and standard diesel buses with electric units in Santo Domingo and modal integration with the metro line. For a full list of discussed investments, including an investment volume of nearly 10 billion USD see file 3 “Pipeline Investment Projects”.

